!resources/builtin-plugins/*/dist/**
# Go launcher binary — built separately in ../syntee-launcher, copied here
# before running build:win so the NSIS installer can ship it.
resources/syntee-launcher.exe

# Rust Sidecar release binary is generated by `npm run build:sidecar`.
# Keep only resources/sidecar/.gitkeep in source control.
